=2 Walkthrough
* After accepting the quest, talk to {n:Nafiwaa} at the Alchemist's Guild in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (G-5).
* After receiving the 5 test tube key items, visit various ponds in {z:Bhaflau Thickets} and {z:Wajaom Woodlands}:

|^Empty test tube|Pond Location|Test tube
|{k:Empty test tube #1|Empty test tube 1}|{z:Wajaom Woodlands} (H-11)|{k:Test tube #1|Test tube 1}
|{k:Empty test tube #2|Empty test tube 2}|{z:Wajaom Woodlands} (G-11)|{k:Test tube #2|Test tube 2}
|{k:Empty test tube #3|Empty test tube 3}|{z:Wajaom Woodlands} (I-7)|{k:Test tube #3|Test tube 3}
|{k:Empty test tube #4|Empty test tube 4}|{z:Wajaom Woodlands} (J-8)|{k:Test tube #4|Test tube 4}
|{k:Empty test tube #5|Empty test tube 5}|{z:Bhaflau Thickets} (G-7)|{k:Test tube #5|Test tube 5}

* Return to {n:Nafiwaa} for a cutscene and begin the mixing process.
* The quality of the mixture determines your imperial currency reward. The best quality possible is __Luminium__.
** To obtain Luminium choose Test Tube #3 three times, Test Tube #2 once, Test Tube #4 once, and Test Tube #5 once.
* Wait a game day and zone at least once, and then return to {n:Abquhbah} for a cutscene.
* Choose __Helping his fellow mercenaries__ to complete the quest.

